# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Persistent simulations on a GPU (D196), scenario errors-stops of
# Inputs/python_segments.py.
# Refusals (a negative count, an end between the two steps
# of the barostat, NPT coupled every step, run(n) on a minimization, a
# stale program), a failed run that leaves Python alive, and stops from
# another thread and from Ctrl-C.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_segments.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir %t errors-stops | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: segments errors-stops passed
